The Guitarists Club            NannyMUD Times                        Page 14

  The Guitarists Club was founded by Mirage to show people how a 
  guitar works, or just to show off.
  
  They have their own chatline, although it is not very active.
  Joining is not that hard. You just need to find a guitar and give it to 
  the teacher and presto! you are in the club.
  
    "The club can be found on the continent of Antharis, far south of 
    Basalt Keep, at the entrance of Mirage's area. In a hut there lives 
    Jan van der Broek. He is a hermit, and an excellent guitar player. 
    He also likes to teach guitar, even though he is a bit impatient. 
    To join the club all you need is a guitar. If you bring him a guitar, 
    you become a member of the club. A guitar can be found somewhere in 
    Mirage's area, but it is said that there is also a quest somewhere 
    else in Nanny that involves building a guitar."
  
  But, joining is half the trouble. Learning how to play the guitar may be
  difficlut for someone that just joined. There are a lot of lessons to 
  study, but fear not, the teacher can help you.
  
    "As a guitarist, you can be taught how to play notes, chords, and 
    eventually complete songs. The songs can be played anywhere, so 
    you could start a concert at the green if you like. The club also 
    has a clubline where your clubtitle is shown. The title depends on 
    your skill as a guitarist. The more chords and songs you know, the 
    better the title will look and the higher you will climb on the 
    line order, and the toplist. The best guitarists will be known as 
    the Jimi Hendrix reincarnation."
    
  So join and start learning to play the guitar, then you can go 
  and show off!
  

